window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p>Drake’s a very angry and (quite literally) heartless orphan obsessed with avenging his parents. Balt is a sometimes-thief from another world who’s trying to get home and maybe make some friends along the way. Cammie is an agent who just wants to retire. And then there are the hand hats...</p> <p> Together, they confront an evil greater than any of them have imagined.</p>"; 
